  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection, CP/GBV 2025 in Kassala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This partnership with UNHCR is Prevention and mitigation of child protection risks, including sexual and gender based violence (SGBV), for refugee&apos;s children and adolescents (ages 0-17) in Kassala state. The population served _x000d_
in this project includes children and adolescents (0-17) in Kassala refugee camps of Girba, Kilo26, Shagrab 1, _x000d_
Shagrab 2, and Shagrab 3, Abuda and Wadsherifay. PIS will continue to support People with Special Needs (PSNs) _x000d_
including, children and adolescents with disabilities and with chronic diseases etc.</narrative>
  </description>
